# Finding 2: storage description rdfs:seeAlso -> /vault/wiki/sources/ returns 404.
# sources/ was MERGED into concepts/ under D98 (Source pages now live in the
# concepts container). Same half-migration as finding 1: overlay migrated,
# static config did not.

<urn:uuid:d25f6b39-f51a-4a1e-8356-ac7b60117df2>
    a as:Announce, mem:RealignAction, prov:Activity ;
    as:actor <urn:agent:claude-code> ;
    as:target </vault/wiki/working/curator-proposals/> ;
    as:object <https://pod.vardeman.me/vault/.well-known/solid> ;
    prov:wasAssociatedWith <urn:agent:claude-code> ;
    prov:used <https://pod.vardeman.me/vault/settings/publicTypeIndex> ;       # ground truth: wiki:Source -> wiki/concepts/
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <https://pod.vardeman.me/vault/wiki/sources/> ;        # the stale target (404)
    mem:stalenessClass mem:SupersededConcept ;
    mem:rationale "Storage description rdfs:seeAlso names /vault/wiki/sources/ which 404s. Type Index reg1-wiki-memory routes wiki:Source to /vault/wiki/concepts/ (NOT a separate sources/ container) — confirming sources were merged into concepts under D98, matching the owner's recollection that 'sources got merged in'. This is SupersededConcept rather than a simple MovedTarget: the separate sources container concept was retired, not relocated. Realign by dropping the sources/ seeAlso term from static config; concepts/ (already emitted by the overlay) is the single durable+source container." ;
    as:published "2026-05-23T22:33:41Z"^^xsd:dateTime .

